# Generated and pinned files are compared byte for byte (`surrealkit compile --check`,
# golden and snapshot tests), so they keep LF line endings in every checkout, Windows
# included. They are also marked generated, so reviews and language statistics skip them.
examples/effect-typegen/src/generated/** text eol=lf linguist-generated
packages/effect-surrealkit/test/golden/** text eol=lf linguist-generated
crates/surrealkit/tests/fixtures/typegen_corpus/** text eol=lf
crates/surrealkit/tests/fixtures/typegen_corpus/compiled/** linguist-generated
crates/surrealkit/tests/fixtures/typegen_corpus/introspection/** linguist-generated
crates/surrealkit/tests/snapshots/** text eol=lf linguist-generated
crates/surrealkit/src/**/snapshots/** text eol=lf linguist-generated
